426
01:06:39,950 --> 01:06:41,491
Here are her hospital records .

427
01:07:19,533 --> 01:07:23,116
This is Siam Rach Hospital , Siam Rach .

428
01:07:23,616 --> 01:07:25,200
" Si-am-la ? "

